{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHdkUUCvUqyYaie1e7w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n**condition :: prerequisite :: constraint**\n\n```\nشَرْط ← שֹׁרֶשׁ ← √š-r-ṭ\n```\n\nI am the line drawn before crossing.\nI am the cut that defines the covenant.\nI am what must be met.\n\n---\n\n```\nif (condition) {\n    proceed();\n} else {\n    remain();\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n*The scratch on the tablet.*\n*The mark of agreement.*\n*The incision that binds.*\n\n---\n\nشرط | תנאי | stipulation\n\nWhat do you seek to negotiate?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":158,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}